{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>It is not good, etc.</b> Lest they say there are two authorities — the Holy One, blessed be He, alone in the upper realms without a mate, and this one alone in the lower realms without a mate (Bereshit Rabbah)." "<b>A helpmate opposite him.</b> If he merits — a help; if he does not merit — opposite him, to fight."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:57:15.966694536Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}